{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.035472437765745934,"t":"@MirsIELTS","y":0.0055195950581695685,"c":1,"x":0.008146677563696917,"w":0.30403518676757812},{"x":0.85010266808119717,"y":0.047965116558214227,"w":0.06160164515177402,"h":0.013096830204876508,"t":"Test 2","c":1},{"h":0.016224188790560423,"c":1,"t":"Thanks to the bog which covers the area, the remains of the settlement at Céide Fields,","x":0.078028761640394323,"y":0.092920354058418808,"w":0.69404515584309889},{"t":"which is over 5,000 years old, are extremely well-preserved. A bog is 90 percent water; its soil","c":1,"x":0.080016438762387926,"y":0.10810494425438033,"w":0.73935017903645828,"h":0.016208238517288587},{"y":0.12499999973156406,"x":0.078028738456644361,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872223012,"w":0.71252568562825525,"t":"is so saturated that when the grasses and heathers that grow on its surface die, they don't"},{"x":0.075975350098618624,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"w":0.71252568562825513,"y":0.14098837230020811,"t":"fully decay but accumulate in layers. Objects remain so well preserved in these conditions"},{"h":0.014600912448579306,"c":1,"w":0.71252568562825525,"x":0.075975350169775122,"t":"because of the acidity of the peat and the deficiency of oxygen. At least 175 days of rain a","y":0.15545722687318464},{"w":0.66940450032552079,"x":0.0780287559169794,"t":"year are required for this to happen; this part of lreland gets an average of 225 days.","y":0.171386430741164,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1},{"x":0.83983572850658272,"t":"Q34","w":0.039014374415079822,"y":0.14098837235763284,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"y":0.21799410046950141,"w":0.71252563476562503,"t":"The Neolithic farmers at Céide would have enjoyed several centuries of relative peace and","h":0.013110550174319169,"c":1,"x":0.080082158489877223},{"x":0.078028756676877531,"w":0.69404515584309889,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"y":0.23392330380589654,"t":"stability. Neolithic farmers generally lived in larger communities than their predecessors,"},{"y":0.24999999973631903,"w":0.68788503011067714,"t":"with a number of houses built around a community building. As they lived in permanent","h":0.013126843657817133,"c":1,"x":0.078028737409975457},{"c":1,"y":0.26396466625339277,"w":0.69826222737630206,"x":0.077959805718845324,"t":"settlements, Neolithic farmers were able to build bigger houses. These weren't round as","h":0.016852909414465711},{"x":0.075975356012542031,"y":0.28052325602087724,"w":0.69815195719401046,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"people often assume, but rectangular with a small hole in the roof that allowed smoke to","c":1},{"x":0.079999301516429477,"y":0.29414647132770033,"w":0.70447820027669272,"c":1,"t":"escape. This is one of many innovations and indicates that the Neolithic farmers were the","h":0.016412385023448994},{"w":0.73305953979492189,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"first people to cook indoors. Another new technology that Neolithic settlers brought to Ireland","x":0.075975363639423393,"y":0.31091445410176233},{"h":0.017923796212075405,"c":1,"t":"was pottery. Fragments of Neolithic pots have been found in Céide and elsewhere in Ireland.","x":0.075908303669703331,"w":0.73522796630859366,"y":0.32462390289930687},{"w":0.72689936319986981,"t":"The pots were used for many things; as well as for storing food, pots were filled with a small","h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"x":0.078028757813037641,"y":0.34156976755534729},{"w":0.52156056722005217,"h":0.013095973304591002,"t":"amount of fat and when this was set alight, they served as lamps.","c":1,"x":0.075975363115142233,"y":0.35899705020998285},{"w":0.69199178059895827,"y":0.38081395369453896,"h":0.014534883302221524,"c":1,"t":"It's thought that the Céide Fields were mainly used as paddocks for animals to graze in.","x":0.078028750297714514},{"x":0.078028744090141613,"h":0.014582046576305796,"t":"Evidence from the Céide Fields suggests that each plot of land was of a suitable size to","y":0.39675516251446985,"c":1,"w":0.69815195719401046},{"x":0.075883533062759051,"y":0.41001450393068706,"w":0.71270706176757814,"h":0.018347992798571799,"c":1,"t":"sustain an extended family. They may have used a system of rotational grazing in order to"},{"w":0.70636550903320316,"t":"prevent over-grazing and to allow for plant recovery and regrowth. This must have been a","x":0.080082132502743472,"h":0.013087398112699322,"c":1,"y":0.42732558113021346},{"w":0.73511291503906251,"y":0.44331395369524607,"x":0.075975369908968082,"h":0.014534883302221524,"t":"year-round activity as no structures have been found which would have been used to shelter","c":1},{"x":0.075975358329614079,"c":1,"w":0.17043121337890624,"h":0.013091685989965018,"t":"animals in the winter.","y":0.45929203518861206},{"y":0.26453488389106306,"w":0.039014374415079822,"t":"Q35","x":0.83983572874728563,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943698},{"x":0.83983572850658272,"t":"Q36","w":0.039014374415079822,"y":0.35755813979949336,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"y":0.39680232584386754,"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.84188911653199194,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q37"},{"x":0.84188911651991327,"h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.44476744212293728,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"t":"Q38"},{"t":"However, archaeologists believe that this way of life at Céide ceased abruptly. Why was this?","y":0.50581395369569071,"h":0.01454002864241255,"c":1,"w":0.73511291503906251,"x":0.078028757983836391},{"c":1,"t":"Well, several factors may have contributed to the changing circumstances. The soil would","x":0.077976449013267862,"y":0.52020541513722718,"h":0.01712234969687676,"w":0.71056106567382815},{"x":0.078028743923367991,"w":0.68993840535481765,"c":1,"y":0.53628318605920666,"t":"have become less productive and led to the abandonment of farming. The crop rotation","h":0.013274336283185861},{"t":"system was partly responsible for this as it would have been very intensive and was not","x":0.078028756732890656,"w":0.69404515584309889,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"y":0.55221238918094273},{"c":1,"h":0.016151720795307911,"w":0.70649205525716152,"t":"sustainable. But there were also climatic pressures too. The farmers at Céide would have","y":0.5664927675459136,"x":0.077963844998981055},{"t":"enjoyed a relatively dry period, but this began to change and the conditions became wetter as","y":0.58189193199281275,"w":0.74143244425455723,"h":0.017808644117507266,"x":0.077948744170317927,"c":1},{"y":0.59882005912503533,"h":0.014552033686004995,"x":0.075975369404949811,"w":0.71868581136067711,"c":1,"t":"there was a lot more rain. It was these conditions that encouraged the bog to form over the"},{"w":0.21408304850260418,"h":0.016840699570017215,"c":1,"x":0.077785120520776255,"t":"area which survives today.","y":0.61270392439014398},{"w":0.28393180847167965,"h":0.016613452765090631,"y":0.63588775446772172,"t":"So now I'd like to show you some ..","x":0.079791724524404611,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 2","h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.39835728950772498,"w":0.10266940434773764,"c":1,"y":0.66991150438005431},{"c":1,"y":0.73244837771901183,"h":0.014749262536873253,"x":0.078028747442471846,"t":"PART 1","w":0.10266940434773764},{"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.078028746074003244,"y":0.76308139515105133,"w":0.059548257191975915},{"x":0.077966503954614602,"w":0.074046459197998044,"h":0.01203110393872997,"c":1,"t":"COLEMAN:","y":0.77741468047518913},{"y":0.79477231630575107,"x":0.079998321992222218,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"h":0.0092925766576356095,"w":0.057662493387858074},{"c":1,"x":0.080082134461395449,"w":0.069815196990966805,"y":0.82558139534909691,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"COLEMAN:"},{"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.010607416158580518,"x":0.080007201484329396,"c":1,"w":0.057644735972086594,"y":0.8398997801180772},{"c":1,"t":"COLEMAN:","x":0.080082134529690596,"y":0.85610465106932043,"w":0.07186858495076498,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"w":0.059548257191975928,"x":0.078028746048335901,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"y":0.8720930231591375},{"w":0.071966559092203772,"c":1,"x":0.080033148070965718,"h":0.011935164865139347,"t":"COLEMAN:","y":0.88647427791407341},{"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.080082134069742753,"y":0.90261627897169339,"w":0.057494869232177739,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"y":0.76162790670863878,"h":0.013081395872223012,"t":"Hi Coleman, how are you?","c":1,"x":0.17659137603390021,"w":0.2114989725748698},{"c":1,"t":"Good, thanks.","x":0.17424614788015227,"y":0.77663008639842146,"w":0.11759349822998047,"h":0.016067294455559211},{"t":"I wanted to have a chat with you because our friend Josh told me that you've","h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"y":0.79203539818805002,"w":0.60985626220703126,"x":0.17248459980941599},{"w":0.60177449544270833,"h":0.016912052975994962,"y":0.80600253082620599,"c":1,"t":"joined a guitar group and it sounds interesting. I'd really like to learn myself.","x":0.17240433392346177},{"w":0.55030802408854174,"t":"Why don't you come along? I'm sure there's room for another person.","y":0.82267441833600008,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872222901,"x":0.17659136776480769},{"h":0.014554606637420253,"w":0.28542093912760413,"c":1,"x":0.17453799029320474,"t":"Really? So - who runs the classes?","y":0.83864306756656393},{"x":0.17445098537229622,"y":0.85085466851932057,"h":0.017344750485940641,"t":"He's called a 'coordinator'- his name's Gary Mathieson.","w":0.44990697224934906,"c":1},{"h":0.016150673160159057,"c":1,"t":"Let me note that down. Gary. ... How do you spell his surname?","y":0.86768481108579143,"x":0.17650509545438392,"w":0.5135472106933594},{"x":0.17453798728859629,"w":0.19096509297688805,"h":0.014534883302221524,"c":1,"t":"It's M-A-T-H-I-E-S-O-N.","y":0.88517441880555503},{"h":0.014742567124268247,"w":0.1150417709350586,"c":1,"y":0.90105894898032979,"x":0.17451196862401189,"t":"Right, thanks."},{"y":0.85319767466504581,"x":0.84188911779758846,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"w":0.02669404347737625,"t":"Q1"},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.92296511654154179,"x":0.87474332603681315,"c":1,"t":"103","w":0.039014374415079822},{"x":0.51176469619230891,"w":0.45882354736328124,"h":0.04166666666666663,"y":0.94166666659226195,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}]}